"""
Bootstrap: Typy rebuilding Typy.

The compiler is written in Typy. Its sources live in ``source/`` (mirroring
this package's layout) and every ``.py`` file of the package is their
compiled form, produced by Typy itself:

    python -m Typy.bootstrap            recompile source/ into the package
    python -m Typy.bootstrap --check    verify the package is exactly what its
                                        own sources compile to (a fixpoint)

``_stage0.py`` is all that is left of the Python host that compiled the very
first Typy-written compiler.

Since: 1.5.0 (self-rebuilding since 2.0.0)
"""

